    {
      "name": "1 500 × 1 500 image, 40 questions",
      "data": "N = 1500\nimage = [[\"0\"] * N for _ in range(N)]\ncr, cc, rad = 700, 650, 500                 # a filled diamond ...\nfor r in range(cr - rad, cr + rad + 1):\n    half = rad - abs(r - cr)\n    image[r][cc - half:cc + half + 1] = [\"1\"] * (2 * half + 1)\nfor c in range(cc + rad, 1401):             # ... with a thin arm out to the right ...\n    image[cr][c] = \"1\"\nfor r in range(30, cr + 1):                 # ... and up to row 30\n    image[r][1400] = \"1\"\nqueries = [(cr, 1400), (30, 1400), (cr - rad, cc), (cr + rad, cc), (cr, cc - rad)]\nqueries += [(cr + k * 37 % 401 - 200, cc + k * 53 % 401 - 200) for k in range(35)]   # inside the diamond",
      "expr": "[min_area(image, x, y) for x, y in queries]",
      "expected": "[1464921] * 40",
      "hidden": true,
      "hint": "Checking every pixel (or visiting every black pixel) is too slow. Binary search for the top and bottom rows and the left and right columns, checking one whole row or column per step."
    }
